                                "sense_id": "fff0a239-0494-38e6-bbbc-3f52d8a5d98d",
                                "text": "1824, Blackwood's magazine, Volume 16, Letters of Timothy Tickler, Esp. No. XVIII.\nIt is sufficient to have given all who understand anything about such matters, a glimpse of the awful cimmerianism of the philologer and classical critic of the Edinburgh Review."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "23a96fc9-b9a4-403f-8b2d-9c1ff6bfa9c1",
                                "sense_id": "fff0a239-0494-38e6-bbbc-3f52d8a5d98d",
                                "text": "I earnestly recommend to those who are sensible of their own culpable deficiencies in these branches of information, or rather indeed I should say, of common education, to remain no longer in their present Cimmerianism."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
